* Wu 2023 candidate sdevice.par — ASSUMPTIONS until T-2022.03 run
* x=device depth top p -> bottom n, assume Ga-polar c-axis pointing up.
* Orientation source: Sentaurus III-N example (must verify Wu polarity).
LatticeParameters {
  X = (0, 0, -1)
  Y = (1, 0, 0)
}

* Generic III-N Mg incomplete-ionization E_0 model, not Wu's parameter.
* Confirm Mg is active acceptor in installed datexcodes.txt.
Material = "GaN" {
  Ionization {
    Species ("MagnesiumActiveConcentration") {
      E_0   = 0.15
      alpha = 0.0
      g     = 4.0
      Xsec  = 1.0e-12
    }
  }
}

* Additional interface model — not verified Wu exact model.
Thermionic {
  Formula = 1
}

* Field-dependent trapping proxy, not Wu parameter calibration.
PooleFrenkel {
  epsPF = 9.5 , 9.5
}
